              "heading": "A tune in Do and Re",
              "minutes": 3,
              "cells": [
                {"type": "text", "text": "Press Play below to hear the tune: the mic starts with it. Sing along on the note names. Once it feels easy, sing it first and press Play to check."},
                {"type": "tool", "tool": {"type": "melody-singer", "pick": {"difficulty": "easy", "stage": "do-re"}, "key": "c", "voice": "alto"}}
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Step by ear",
          "minutes": 3,
          "level": "new",
